      "message": "Merge main into issue/1199-undeclared-dialect (adopt #1174's work_voice)\n\ndialect.rs: take main's WorkVoice/work_voice (drops this branch's\ndeclared_turning). lathe_voice::at_post matches on WorkVoice:\nToolSpindle passes, WorkSpindle holds, Undeclared holds on a lathe or\nmill-turn. Masks 0 and 4 are now Undeclared (stricter than before).\nlathe_workholding_mill_post: an undeclared script's milling section on\na chucked machine is refused by the lathe door first, as a turning\npost's is. Decision file updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
